1. Which utility creates an empty PS file?
Correct – IEFBR14 creates or deletes datasets through JCL allocation.

4. Which utility copies one PS file to another?
Correct – IEBGENER is commonly used to copy sequential datasets.

Utility	Purpose
IEFBR14	Create/delete datasets using DD allocation
IEBGENER	Copy sequential files
IEBCOPY	Copy/compress PDS or PDSE libraries
IEBCOMPR	Compare two sequential datasets
IDCAMS	VSAM dataset operations
DFSORT / SORT	Sort records
ICETOOL	Advanced file processing


